06:05.470 --> 06:06.373
it would look like this,

06:06.373 --> 06:10.354
if you were graphing rate
of change, let me do that,

06:10.354 --> 06:13.354
if you were to graph rate of change,

06:14.355 --> 06:17.188
DP DT as a function of population,

06:18.396 --> 06:22.563
well when the population is
small, so when the population

06:24.340 --> 06:28.350
