07:22.229 --> 07:25.146
which we actually just figured out,

07:26.655 --> 07:30.584
the vertex is just gonna
be half way between that.

07:30.584 --> 07:34.411
So when the population is zero
our rate of change is zero

07:34.411 --> 07:38.315
